  0100 Saturday 28 and all day Sunday 29 November\, including Friday and Sa
 turday Night Overground\, no service between Highbury & Islington and Batt
 ersea Park / Clapham Junction / New Cross / New Cross Gate. Use MILDMAY LI
 NE services between Highbury & Islington\, Canonbury and Dalston Kingsland
 . Replacement bus services operate.\nTfL live status (Reduced Service\, ch
 ecked 27 November 2026): WINDRUSH LINE: Saturday 28 and Sunday 29 November
