DESCRIPTION:📢 Update from TfL's live status (not in the planned closure
 s list)\n\nWINDRUSH LINE: Monday 30 November\, Tuesday 1\, Wednesday 2 and
  Thursday 3 December\, after 2215 each evening\, no service between Sydenh
 am and West Croydon. West Croydon trains will divert to and depart from Cr
 ystal Palace. Use local buses via any reasonable route or Southern Railway
  trains between Sydenham and Norwood Junction. Tickets will also be accept
 ed on Southern Railway trains between Crystal Palace and East Croydon (via
  Norwood Junction)\, and on two Southern Railway rail replacement buses de
 parting Norwood Junction at 2318 and 0013 for West Croydon via Selhurst (a
 nd onward to Sutton). Last through trains: Highbury & Islington to West Cr
 oydon 2147\; West Croydon to Highbury & Islington 2246\n\nFrom TfL's live 
 status (Part Closure)\, checked 27 November 2026.\n\nPlans can change. Che
 ck before you travel: https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/\nPowe
 red by TfL Open Data\nUnofficial calendar\, not produced or endorsed by Tr
 ansport for London.
